  "description": "Full-Terrain Suspension for Any Ride\nBuilt for rugged terrain, the Patrol combines a 150 mm long-travel hydraulic front fork with lockout and a rear hydraulic shock to absorb hard hits and rough trails. The full-suspension setup enhances stability and traction, giving you better control and a smoother ride across dirt, rocks, and uneven ground.\n4000W Motor Hub\nThe Patrol dirt eBike features a high-performance motor with up to 4000W peak power and 145 Nm of torque, delivering powerful acceleration and outstanding climbing ability. It sprints from 0–20 mph in just 3.5 seconds, giving you instant power for steep hills and rugged dirt trails.\n52V/ 30Ah Battery\nEquipped with a 1560Wh (52V 30Ah) battery, the Patrol delivers up to 50 miles of range for demanding off-road rides. The removable design allows easy charging anywhere, while 15–80% fast charging in just 3.5 hours means less waiting and more riding.\nSmart NFC Access\nThe Patrol is equipped with an NFC card access system for fast and secure bike activation. Simply tap the card to power on—no physical keys required. This intelligent system enhances security while providing a seamless and convenient riding experience.",
